{
  "slug": "leader-as-coach",
  "name": "Leader As Coach",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "A 6-month AI coaching development programme that teaches managers to lead as coaches. 24 weekly coaching models, practical tools, and a 15-question diagnostic. By Leadership by Design.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **9 skills** and **1 agent**.\n\n- **Skills** (9): `coaching-model` (Quick reference for all 24 coaching models in the Leader as Coach programme), `coaching-tools` (Reference list of practical tools and templates available in the Leader as Coach programme), `diagnostic` (Run the Leader as Coach diagnostic), `month-1-foundations` (Month 1 of the Leader as Coach programme), `month-2-conversations` (Month 2 of the Leader as Coach programme), `month-3-behaviour` (Month 3 of the Leader as Coach programme), `month-4-mindset` (Month 4 of the Leader as Coach programme), `month-5-teams` (Month 5 of the Leader as Coach programme), and 1 more\n- **Agents** (1): `coach`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install leader-as-coach@claude-community` from `LBD-DASH/leader-as-coach`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 9,
    "agent": 1
  },
